  "instructions": [
    "Thinly slice the hispi sweetheart cabbage and place it in a large bowl.",
    "Add the cooked bulgur, diced confit tomatoes, chopped parsley, crumbled feta cheese, paprika, salt, and black pepper to the bowl.",
    "Drizzle the pomegranate molasses and lemon juice over the salad and toss to combine.",
    "Drizzle the olive oil over the salad and toss to combine.",
    "Season the salad with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "Just before serving, garnish the salad with additional parsley and a sprinkle of paprika.",
    "Serve the salad chilled, garnished with additional parsley and a sprinkle of paprika if desired."
